%p
  %em Timeless
  is a non-rotating Constructed format consisting of all cards legal on Magic: The Gathering Arena.

%p
  Unlike Historic it has no banned cards, only restricted ones, of which you may play a single copy in your deck and sideboard combined. Also unlike Historic, it uses the original version of any card which has an Alchemy rebalance, not the rebalanced one.

%p
  Cards marked "conjurable" or "specialized" are not a banlist decision - they can only be created during the game, never put in a deck.
